# Experiment data: run folders are bulky and reproducible from a seed, but the
# aggregated CSVs summarize.py writes are small and worth keeping.
# Exclude the *contents*, not the directory: git cannot re-include a file whose
# parent directory is excluded, so "results/" would make the negation dead.
results/*
!results/*.csv
